#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access (Service API Token + LAN / local HTTPS)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Hub 业务 API（Hub RPC `POST|WS /hub/rpc/v1` + MCP）须带 **per-subject Service API Token**（`Authorization: Bearer fa_at_...` 或 WS `connect.auth_token`）。\n"
"> Security context: [`security.md`](security.md) · Install: [`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                    | Role                                                                                                                               |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**    | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；Hub RPC HTTP `Authorization: Bearer`；WS `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer                 |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**        | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                                                      |\n"
"| **`http.host`**          | Hub listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                                            |\n"
"| **`http.allowed_hosts`** | TLS 证书 SAN 额外主机名 / IP（`http.host: 0.0.0.0` 时列出客户端访问用的名称）；变更后 `auto: true` 时重启自动重签                  |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`**  | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (dev:web, split UI/API reverse proxy)                                                        |\n"
"| **Client settings**      | Desktop / mobile shell / **browser Web** fill Hub URL and token in **Hub settings**                                                |\n"
"| **Remote UI**            | 浏览器/PWA 从 Hub `/web/*` 加载；Desktop/Mobile 默认安装包内本地 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                  | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                                        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:24
msgid ""
"公网暴露不在产品内置范围内：请使用局域网、`http.tls` 本地 HTTPS，或自行搭建反"
"向代理 / VPN。旧版 `tunnel` 配置段已废弃并忽略。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "PWA（浏览器 Web）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**Secure context**：Service Worker 需要 HTTPS 或 `localhost`。局域网可用 Hub "
"本地 HTTPS（`:2659`）或自建 TLS 终止。浏览器 **Web Speech** 朗读同样需安全上"
"下文；默认 **Edge TTS**（Hub `POST /hub/rpc/v1/tts/synthesize`）在 HTTP 局域"
"网下也可用，但 Hub 需能访问外网 Microsoft 语音服务。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**Service Worker vs 安装**：SW 在普通浏览器标签页访问 `/web/*` 时即注册（生产"
"构建）；**不要求**「添加到主屏幕」。安装仅改变启动方式（独立窗口），离线能力"
"与标签页相同。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**安装（可选）**：手机浏览器访问 `/web/chat`，Chrome / Safari 支持「添加到主"
"屏幕」；生产构建会显示安装引导条（compact 布局、非已安装态）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**更新**：Hub 部署新 Web 静态产物后，已安装 PWA 会提示「新版本可用」；点击重"
"新加载后生效（不会自动刷新）。壳层 JS 由 Workbox precache，生产环境会定期/"
"`visibilitychange` 时 `registration.update()`。`/web/config.json` 始终 `no-"
"store`（Hub URL 动态）。Desktop/Mobile 不走 SW；升级见 Releases 安装包检测"
"（设置 → 关于「检查更新」）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid "**离线边界（两层）**："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**壳层（SW）**：仅缓存 JS/CSS/HTML 等静态资源，保证断网时页面框架可加载。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**业务快照（IndexedDB）**：Chat / Task / Project / Notification / Diary / "
"Email / Dream / Pomodoro（config/历史）及 Console 部分只读页由 `shell-sdk/"
"offline-cache` 做 cache-first；**Tier 2 可写**模块（Diary、Task、Project、"
"Chat send、Pomodoro outbox）离线可编辑，恢复在线后 outbox flush；详见 "
"[`offline-platform.md`](offline-platform.md)。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**离线边界**：浏览器 `offline` 时 Tier 1 模块只读展示快照；"
"**offlineWritable** 模块（Diary、Task、Project、Chat、Pomodoro）仍可本地编辑"
"并排队待同步。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**存储**：SW 缓存、localStorage（Hub 设置）、IndexedDB（业务快照）互不冲突；"
"清除站点数据会同时删除三者。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:38
msgid ""
"Registry 标记 `auth: optional` 的 Hub RPC 方法（如 `health.probe`、"
"`tls.ca.*`）与 CORS 预检可不带 Bearer；其余 `/hub/rpc/v1/*` 与 MCP 须 "
"Bearer。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. 创建 token（冷启动）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap\n"
"# 终端打印 fa_at_...（仅此一次）→ 填入客户端 Hub 设置\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:47
msgid "列出 / 撤销："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima token list --subject-id 1\n"
"anima token revoke <token_id>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:54
msgid "Console Hub RPC REST（需已认证 `full` token）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:58
msgid ""
"`GET /hub/rpc/v1/tokens/listForSubject?id=:id`（或 "
"`hub().call(\"tokens.listForSubject\", { id })`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:58
msgid ""
"`POST /hub/rpc/v1/tokens/createForSubject` — body `{ \"id\": <subject_id>, "
"\"name\": \"desktop\" }`，响应含一次性 `plaintext`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:58
msgid "`POST /hub/rpc/v1/tokens/revoke` — body `{ \"id\": <token_id> }`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Listen address (`http.host`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default bind is `127.0.0.1:2658` (loopback only). For LAN access via `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web` or a local hostname such as `http://galaxy:2658/web`, set:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:69
msgid ""
"Multiple binds (distinct interfaces only — not client-facing aliases). Use "
"`0.0.0.0` instead of listing every IP; do not mix `0.0.0.0` with specific "
"addresses. Hostnames must resolve on the Hub machine (`/etc/hosts` or DNS):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host:\n"
"    - 127.0.0.1\n"
"    - 10.244.0.2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:78
msgid ""
"CLI `--host` overrides config for a single run / systemd unit write. After "
"changing `http.host`, run `anima service restart`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "LAN: `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web/chat` with `http.host: 0.0.0.0` (or `anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`); clients set Hub URL to `http://<PC-IP>:2658` (no `/web` suffix).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cross-origin (`http.cors_origins`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:84
msgid ""
"When the browser UI and Hub API share the same origin (e.g. Hub `/web` + "
"same-host `/api`), **no CORS config is needed**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:86
msgid ""
"Add origins only for **cross-origin** cases (e.g. Vite dev server, external "
"reverse proxy splitting UI and API):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  cors_origins:\n"
"    - http://127.0.0.1:4173\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:94
msgid "CORS is **not** derived from `web.public_url`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub 本地 HTTPS（双端口，可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:98
msgid "Hub 可在 **独立端口** 提供原生 TLS（`Bun.serve`），与默认 HTTP 并行："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 端口     | 协议  | 用途                                                                                  |\n"
"| -------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **2658** | HTTP  | 默认；CLI 探活、日常客户端、局域网访问                                                |\n"
"| **2659** | HTTPS | 本地/局域网安全上下文（Web Speech / PWA 等）；客户端 Hub URL 填 `https://<host>:2659` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:105
msgid "启用（`~/.anima/config.yaml` bootstrap 段）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
"  allowed_hosts:\n"
"    - feng-vm.lan\n"
"    - 10.200.200.10\n"
"  tls:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    port: 2659\n"
"    auto: true\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:120
msgid ""
"**`auto: true`**（默认）：首次启动在 `~/.anima/tls/` 自动生成 cert/key（优先 "
"**mkcert**，否则 **openssl 自签**）；SAN 含 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、"
"`http.host` 中的 bind 地址（跳过 `0.0.0.0`）及 **`http.allowed_hosts`**。配置"
"变更导致 SAN 不足时，**重启 Hub 会自动删除旧证书并重签**（`auto: false` 时仅"
"告警，不覆盖手动证书）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:120
msgid ""
"**探活**：`anima service status` 与 `GET /hub/rpc/v1/health/probe` 仍走 HTTP "
"`:2658`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkcert 根 CA 导入手机（可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:124
msgid ""
"Hub 服务器证书在 Hub 机器上；手机浏览器/APK 无警告访问须在各设备安装 "
"**mkcert 根 CA**（`rootCA.pem`，非 `cert.pem`）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"**设置 → 连接**（`/web/settings?section=hub`）：页面底部提供 **rootCA.pem 下"
"载**与 **二维码**（二维码指向 HTTP `:2658` 下载链接，便于未信任 HTTPS 时扫"
"码）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"若 HTTPS 页面脚本仍报错，请先用 **`http://<host>:2658/web/settings?"
"section=hub`** 打开设置页。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkcert -CAROOT   # 查看 rootCA.pem 路径\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:134
msgid ""
"**iOS**：AirDrop/邮件传 `rootCA.pem` → 安装描述文件 → **设置 → 通用 → 关于本"
"机 → 证书信任设置** → 启用完全信任。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:134
msgid "**Android**：可选转 DER 后 **设置 → 安全 → 安装 CA 证书**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:136
msgid ""
"日常手机访问可用 **HTTP `:2658`（局域网）** 或 **HTTPS `:2659`（装 CA 后）"
"**；公网场景请自建反向代理或 VPN。Capacitor APK 对 user CA 的支持因平台/构建"
"而异。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Client configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Desktop shell** (`src/app/shell/desktop`), **mobile shell** (`src/app/shell/mobile`), and **browser Web** are remote clients; they **do not read** Hub `config.yaml` token.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:146
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Client        | Storage                                          |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Desktop shell | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` (`hub` section) |\n"
"| Mobile shell  | Capacitor Preferences                            |\n"
"| Browser Web   | localStorage (settings page)                     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:148
msgid "Settings (all clients):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:151
msgid ""
"**Hub URL** — e.g. `http://192.168.1.10:2658` or `https://<lan-host>:2659` "
"(Hub root, **without** `/web`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:151
msgid "**Hub API Token** — `fa_at_...` from `anima token create`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:153
msgid ""
"Browser Web: `/web/config.json` defaults Hub to the **page origin** "
"(production Hub-hosted `/web` and Vite `dev:web`). Source `dev:hub` writes "
"`~/.anima/dev-web.token`; Vite injects it as `remote_auth_token` so the "
"first visit need not paste a token. Production Hub never puts tokens in "
"`config.json` — use `anima token create` and Hub settings."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:155
msgid ""
"Flow: open Hub settings → fill → **Test connection** → Save. Desktop "
"requires **restart desktop shell** after save."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Authentication behavior"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:158
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer fa_at_<prefix>_<secret>\n"
"Hub RPC: WebSocket /hub/rpc/v1 → connect frame includes auth_token\n"
"MCP:   POST/GET /mcp → Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:165
msgid ""
"`/web/*` static assets skip service auth; `/api` and `/mcp` require Bearer "
"token."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:167
msgid "Missing or invalid token → HTTP `401` or Hub RPC connection closed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:168
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. MCP outbound (external agents query Hub data)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:171
msgid ""
"Hub serves Streamable HTTP MCP Server at **`/mcp`**, exposing read-only "
"tools from ToolSets with `expose_mcp: true` (e.g. `memory_recall`, "
"`conversation_search`). External MCP clients (Cursor, Claude Desktop, etc.) "
"connect **without LLM relay**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:172
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer fa_at_...\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:183
msgid ""
"**Inbound** (Hub connects to external MCP servers): `config.yaml` "
"`mcp_servers` (`src/capabilities/mcp-client`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:183
msgid ""
"**Outbound** (external agents call Hub tools): `/mcp` endpoint (`src/"
"capabilities/mcp-server`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:191
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command                          | Description                                  |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima token create/list/revoke` | Service API Token 管理（CLI，直连 PG）       |\n"
"| `anima web start --foreground`   | Standalone Web static server (debug, `/web`) |\n"
"| `anima service status`           | Hub stack status                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:201
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                | Check                                                                |\n"
"| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Cannot reach Hub       | Is Hub running? `anima service status`; check `http.host` / firewall |\n"
"| 401                    | Client token valid; run `anima token list --subject-id <id>`         |\n"
"| Local OK, remote fails | Remote requests need Bearer / SAP auth_token                         |\n"
"| CORS error in browser  | Add UI origin to `http.cors_origins`, or use Hub `/web` same-origin  |\n"
"| 401 after token change | Update client settings; revoke old tokens if needed                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:205
msgid "Mobile: [`mobile-app.md`](../features/mobile-app.md)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:205
msgid ""
"Desktop companion Hub source: [`companion.md`](../features/companion.md)"
msgstr ""
